<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Inland Steel reduced.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Inland Steel reduced.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it cut the rating on Inland Steel Industries Inc to market perform from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 5/8 to 23-3/4.</p>
</text>
